Implementation:
- Added `app/infrastructure/realtime/supabase-subscription.ts`, a parse-first browser-safe Supabase Realtime refresh payload boundary that validates unknown broadcasts against the authorized refetch plan scope before any UI refetch.
- Added `app/infrastructure/realtime/supabase-subscription.test.ts`, covering accepted refresh-only payloads, malformed/cross-class/stale/wrong-idempotency rejections, and ignoring extra gameplay/provider fields.
- Added `app/realtime-refresh-plan.ts`, a server helper that builds a realtime panel config from the accepted domain descriptor chain and parses browser-safe public Supabase environment values.
- Added `app/realtime-refresh-panel.tsx`, a client panel that subscribes to the descriptor channel/event, displays connecting/subscribed/configuration/provider/rejected/refresh states, validates payloads, and calls `router.refresh()` only after accepted refresh-only broadcasts.
- Wired the panel into protected student `/dashboard` and instructor `/instructor/dashboard` surfaces.

